{
  "_doc": "Date rules of repeating expenses (docs/API.md 'Recurring expenses'). Read by the app's domain/recurrence.dart (test/recurrence_test.dart) and the server's recurrence/Schedule.kt (ScheduleTest.kt). kind=dates: dates[n] = occurrenceDate(frequency, startDate, n), n from 0. Dates are always computed from startDate (not from the previous date): weekly +7n days, biweekly +14n days, monthly +n months, yearly +n years; a day the month doesn't have becomes the month's last day. kind=next: firstOnOrAfter(frequency, startDate, onOrAfter, minN ?? 1) = {n, date}: the smallest n with n ≥ minN and occurrenceDate(n) ≥ onOrAfter. kind=dueAt (server only): 09:00 on date in timeZone (an IANA name or ±HH:MM, ZoneId.of) as a UTC time. kind=crossRate: crossRate(perEur, from, to) = perEur[to] / perEur[from] rounded to 6 significant digits, null when either is missing or ≤ 0 (the app's data/fx_rates.dart crossRate, the server scheduler's rate refresh). The values were computed with Python zoneinfo and Decimal.",
